{"id":"NCT07766005","title":"A Study of SPY072 in Adults With Moderate to Severe Hidradenitis Suppurativa (The SKYLIGHT Trial)","official":"A Phase 2, Multicenter, Randomized, Double-blind, Placebo-controlled, Proof-of-concept Trial to Assess the Efficacy and Safety of SPY072 in Adults With Moderate to Severe Hidradenitis Suppurativa Receiving Standard of Care Treatment","summary":"This Phase 2 study will test whether the investigational medicine, SPY072, improves hidradenitis suppurativa (HS) in adults with moderate to severe disease receiving advanced standard of care treatment. About 150 participants will be assigned by chance to receive either SPY072 or placebo for 16 weeks. Participants will be followed after the treatment period to evaluate safety and how long treatment effects may last.","conditions":["Hidradenitis Suppurativa (HS)"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"SPY072"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Placebo"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"bimekizumab"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Clinical diagnosis of Hidradenitis Suppurativa with symptoms for at least 6 months before screening.\n* Hidradenitis suppurativa lesions in at least 2 distinct anatomical areas, with at least 1 area meeting Hurley Stage II or III criteria at screening and Day 1.\n* Total abscess and/or inflammatory nodule count of at least 5 at screening and Day 1.\n* Documented inadequate response, intolerance, or contraindication to at least 1 systemic therapy for hidradenitis suppurativa.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* More than 20 draining tunnels at screening or Day 1.\n* Hidradenitis suppurativa lesion expected to require incision and drainage within 4 weeks before Day 1, or major hidradenitis suppurativa surgery within 12 weeks before Day 1.\n* Another inflammatory or skin condition that could interfere with assessment of hidradenitis suppurativa.","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"75 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":150,"start":"2026-09","pcd":"2027-10","upd":"2026-10-19","sponsor":"Spyre Therapeutics, Inc.","areas":["other"],"central":["SKYLIGHT Trial Center · 1-702-602-7976 · info@SKYLIGHT-trial.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Site 117","city":"Birmingham","pr":"Alabama","zip":"35244","s":"NYR","lat":33.5207,"lon":-86.8025,"c":"SKYLIGHT Trial Center"},{"f":"Site 119","city":"Rogers","pr":"Arkansas","zip":"72758","s":"NYR","lat":36.332,"lon":-94.1185,"c":"SKYLIGHT Trial Center"},{"f":"Site 111","city":"Irvine","pr":"California","zip":"92614","s":"NYR","lat":33.6695,"lon":-117.8231,"c":"SKYLIGHT Trial Center"},{"f":"Site 113","city":"Coral Gables","pr":"Florida","zip":"33134","s":"NYR","lat":25.7215,"lon":-80.2684,"c":"SKYLIGHT Trial Center"},{"f":"Site 115","city":"Atlanta","pr":"Georgia","zip":"30329","s":"NYR","lat":33.749,"lon":-84.388,"c":"SKYLIGHT Trial Center"},{"f":"Site 101","city":"Indianapolis","pr":"Indiana","zip":"46250","s":"R","lat":39.7684,"lon":-86.158,"c":"SKYLIGHT Trial Center"},{"f":"Site 100","city":"Bowling Green","pr":"Kentucky","zip":"42104","s":"R","lat":36.9903,"lon":-86.4436,"c":"SKYLIGHT Trial Center"},{"f":"Site 116","city":"Owensboro","pr":"Kentucky","zip":"42303","s":"R","lat":37.7742,"lon":-87.1133,"c":"SKYLIGHT Trial Center"},{"f":"Site 108","city":"Baton Rouge","pr":"Louisiana","zip":"70809","s":"NYR","lat":30.4433,"lon":-91.1875,"c":"SKYLIGHT Trial Center"},{"f":"Site 103","city":"Boston","pr":"Massachusetts","zip":"02115","s":"NYR","lat":42.3584,"lon":-71.0598,"c":"SKYLIGHT Trial Center"},{"f":"Site 112","city":"Boston","pr":"Massachusetts","zip":"02115","s":"NYR","lat":42.3584,"lon":-71.0598,"c":"SKYLIGHT Trial Center"},{"f":"Site 127","city":"Detroit","pr":"Michigan","zip":"48202","s":"NYR","lat":42.3314,"lon":-83.0457,"c":"SKYLIGHT Trial Center"},{"f":"Site 120","city":"Las Vegas","pr":"Nevada","zip":"89119","s":"NYR","lat":36.175,"lon":-115.1372,"c":"SKYLIGHT Trial Center"},{"f":"Site 126","city":"Las Vegas","pr":"Nevada","zip":"89145","s":"NYR","lat":36.175,